              "title": "📄 ChatInject: Abusing Chat Templates for Prompt Injection in LLM Agents — Chang et al., ICLR 2026. Formats injected payloads to mimic native chat templates (optionally primed by persuasive multi-turn dialogue) so agents elevate them to system-level trust; transfers across models and largely bypasses prompt-based defenses. Code",
